==English==

===Etymology===
From {{suffix|amuse|er}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Someone who [[amuse]]s.
# {{context|obsolete}} One who [[divert]]s [[attention]], usually to [[distract]] or [[bewilder]], often for [[fraud]]ulent purposes; hence a [[cheat]], [[deceive]]r or [[thief]].

===Anagrams===
* [[Maseru#English|Maseru]], [[Mauser#English|Mauser]]

